# The account the ser2netweb package's service runs as (systemd-sysusers, from the
# package's postinst / %post; where there is no systemd-sysusers it runs useradd instead).
# The unit adds the dialout group for the serial ports (SupplementaryGroups=).
u ser2netweb - "ser2netweb serial-to-network bridge" /var/lib/ser2netweb
